<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AGL half year net up to A$75.6 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AGL half year net up to A$75.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    107.9 vs  92.4</p>
<p>    Net					75.6 vs  63.2</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	    16  vs  13</p>
<p>NOTE: Australian Gas Light Co is a gas producer and distributor.  </p>
<p>    Sales				   492.0 vs  453.6</p>
<p>    Other income			   43.8 vs   41.4</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    26.0 vs   22.2</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs   nil</p>
<p>Dividend</p>
<p>is partly (nine cents) franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 24</p>
<p>Reg date April 10</p>
<p>    Tax					32.2 vs   29.1</p>
<p>    Interest				 18.4 vs   18.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   34.7 vs   30.4</p>
<p>    Minorities			     nil  vs   nil</p>
</text>
